Extension 1: Maximal Rectangle in Binary Matrix
  Build histogram row by row, apply this algorithm per row
Extension 2: Trapping Rain Water
  Similar stack approach, compute water trapped between bars
Key insight: stack gives left AND right boundaries in one pass
```
